WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.507
Watch and read: For your propernouns practice, which spelling correctly writes the

00:00:04.507 --> 00:00:06.301
name of a person: ama?

00:00:07.117 --> 00:00:11.255
The answer is: Ama. Names of people begin with capital letters.

00:00:12.117 --> 00:00:16.628
Watch and read: For your habitual practice, ama does this every school day: read.

00:00:16.628 --> 00:00:18.239
What is the best answer?

00:00:19.117 --> 00:00:24.231
The answer is: Ama reads.. Read the instruction carefully and choose the helpful or

00:00:24.231 --> 00:00:24.962
correct response.
